<h3 class="has-text-align-center has-text-color" style="color:#0e4855;font-size:24px;line-height:1.6;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:16px">聞き方と、開いている時間</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->
<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"color":{"text":"#2b3440"},"typography":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.9"}},"align":"center"} -->
<p class="has-text-align-center has-text-color" style="color:#2b3440;font-size:16px;line-height:1.9">電話がつながりにくいときは、フォームからでも同じ人がお答えします。</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->
<!-- wp:wdl/lw-space-1 {"pcHeight":24,"tbHeight":20,"spHeight":16} -->
<div class="wp-block-wdl-lw-space-1 lw_space_1"><div class="pc" style="height:24px"></div><div class="tb" style="height:20px"></div><div class="sp" style="height:16px"></div></div>
<!-- /wp:wdl/lw-space-1 -->
<!-- wp:wdl/paid-block-lw-company-3 {"dtBackgroundColor":"#165865","borderColor":"#d7e4e8","ddTextColor":"#2b3440","spFullDt":true,"maxWidth":1040} -->
<div class="wp-block-wdl-paid-block-lw-company-3 paid-block-lw-company-3 font_size_m"><dl class="lw-company-3__inner" style="max-width:1040px;line-height:1.6"><div class="lw-company-3__row dt_width_m sp_clm_1"><dt class="lw-company-3__dt" style="background:#165865"><div class="lw-company-3__dt_text" data-lw_font_set="Murecho" style="font-weight:600;line-height:1.6">お電話</div><div class="lw-company-3__dt_arrow" style="background:#165865"></div></dt><dd class="lw-company-3__dd" data-lw_font_set="" style="color:#2b3440;border-color:#d7e4e8;line-height:1.6">000-0000-0000（受付 9:00〜18:30／木・日は 13:00 まで）</dd></div><div class="lw-company-3__row dt_width_m sp_clm_1"><dt class="lw-company-3__dt" style="background:#165865"><div class="lw-company-3__dt_text" data-lw_font_set="Murecho" style="font-weight:600;line-height:1.6">フォーム</div><div class="lw-company-3__dt_arrow" style="background:#165865"></div></dt><dd class="lw-company-3__dd" data-lw_font_set="" style="color:#2b3440;border-color:#d7e4e8;line-height:1.6">24時間お受けします。返信は翌診療日の午前中までにいたします。</dd></div><div class="lw-company-3__row dt_width_m sp_clm_1"><dt class="lw-company-3__dt" style="background:#165865"><div class="lw-company-3__dt_text" data-lw_font_set="Murecho" style="font-weight:600;line-height:1.6">LINE</div><div class="lw-company-3__dt_arrow" style="background:#165865"></div></dt><dd class="lw-company-3__dd" data-lw_font_set="" style="color:#2b3440;border-color:#d7e4e8;line-height:1.6">写真を送っていただけると、来院前におおよそのご案内ができます。</dd></div><div class="lw-company-3__row dt_width_m sp_clm_1"><dt class="lw-company-3__dt" style="background:#165865"><div class="lw-company-3__dt_text" data-lw_font_set="Murecho" style="font-weight:600;line-height:1.6">休診日</div><div class="lw-company-3__dt_arrow" style="background:#165865"></div></dt><dd class="lw-company-3__dd" data-lw_font_set="" style="color:#2b3440;border-color:#d7e4e8;line-height:1.6">祝日。木曜と日曜は午前のみ。</dd></div></dl></div>
